Want to read your favourite WP Books on a plane, commute, or anywhere without Wi-Fi? WP Downloader lets you save stories as EPUB or PDF files for offline reading on any device.

## Choose your format

### EPUB - best for e-readers and reading apps

EPUB is the standard format for e-readers. Text reflows to fit any screen size, and you can adjust font size and brightness.

**Best for:** Kobo, Apple Books, Google Play Books, Moon+ Reader, Kindle (via Send-to-Kindle).

### PDF - best for printing and fixed-layout reading

PDF preserves exact formatting - fonts, spacing, and images - just as the file was generated.

**Best for:** Printing, reading on laptops, tablets with PDF apps, and Kindle via email.

## How to download for offline reading

1. Copy the WP story URL from your browser or the Wattpad app.
2. Go to [WP Downloader](/) and paste the URL.
3. Choose **EPUB** (no account needed) or **PDF** (free Discord sign-in required).
4. Click **Download** and save the file to your device.

## Reading on different devices

### iPhone / iPad
- **EPUB**: Tap the file → Open in Books (Apple Books) or any EPUB reader.
- **PDF**: Tap the file → Open in Files or iBooks.

### Android
- **EPUB**: Open with Moon+ Reader, ReadEra, or any EPUB app.
- **PDF**: Open with Google Drive PDF viewer or your internet browser.

### Kindle
See our guide on [how to send WP stories to Kindle](/help/how-to-send-wattpad-stories-to-kindle/).

### Kobo
- Connect via USB or use the Kobo desktop app to transfer EPUB files to your device.

### Laptop / Desktop
- **EPUB**: Open with Calibre, Thorium Reader, or any EPUB reader.
- **PDF**: Open with any PDF viewer (Adobe Reader, Preview on Mac, Edge on Windows).

## Tips

- **Include images**: Enable the Include Images toggle to embed chapter images in your downloaded file.
- **Storage**: Most WP stories are under 5 MB as EPUB and under 10 MB as PDF - even a full series takes very little space.
